IMPORT `law36-vn28-nouns`
IMPORT `law36-art34-vehicles`
IMPORT `law36-art56-62-licences`
IMPORT `law36-art88-89-transitional`
IMPORT `law36-art9-81-87-alcohol`
IMPORT `law36-art39-40-registration`

-- The three decisions the compulsory-motor-insurance rows (Decree 67/2023, row VN-10) can call,
-- assembled from the Articles of Law 36/2024/QH15 encoded in the modules before this one.
-- (1) Articles 56, 57, 58, 59, 62(5), 88 and 89: may this driver drive this vehicle on this day?
-- (2) Articles 9(2)-(3), 81(3), 83(2)(a), 87(5): does this test exceed the level Decree 67
--     names?
-- (3) Articles 39(6), 40, 88: is the registration or plate revoked, or the vehicle past its
--     service life, on this day?
-- Every decision takes the day as an input. A day before 1 January 2025 is governed by the Road
-- Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 (Article 88(3)), which is not in the sources, and is declined.

§ `The decisions for the insurance rows`

§§ `Refusals the decisions share`

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 57(6)(b)-(d), (8)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`a foreign or international licence is not mapped onto the classes of Article 57 in this model` MEANS
    REFUSE "a foreign or international licence is not mapped onto the classes of Article 57 in this model"

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 59(3), 62(7)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the ages and licences of army and police drivers on defence or security duty are set by their Ministers, whose rules are not in the sources` MEANS
    REFUSE "the ages and licences of army and police drivers on defence or security duty are set by their Ministers, whose rules are not in the sources"

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 34(1)(b)-(c)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`a trailer or semi-trailer is not driven by itself: describe the vehicle that tows it, with its trailer` MEANS
    REFUSE "a trailer or semi-trailer is not driven by itself: describe the vehicle that tows it, with its trailer"

§§ `Decision 1 — the driver's age and licence (Articles 9(1), 56 to 59, 62, 88, 89)`

-- Article 9(1) forbids driving a motor vehicle without the licence the law requires, and a
-- special-use machine without a licence or the law certificate, and the machine certificate.
-- Article 56 says which licence, or certificate, is required; Decision 1 is its test.
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:234 | 1. Điều khiển xe cơ giới tham gia giao thông đường bộ không có giấy phép lái xe
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:235 | theo quy định của pháp luật; điều khiển xe máy chuyên dùng tham gia giao thông
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:236 | đường bộ không có giấy phép lái xe hoặc chứng chỉ bồi dưỡng kiến thức pháp luật về
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:237 | giao thông đường bộ, bằng hoặc chứng chỉ điều khiển xe máy chuyên dùng.
-- src:967 | Điều 56. Điều kiện của người điều khiển phương tiện tham gia giao thông
-- src:968 | đường bộ
-- src:969 | 1. Người lái xe tham gia giao thông đường bộ phải đủ tuổi, sức khỏe theo quy
-- src:970 | định của pháp luật; có giấy phép lái xe đang còn điểm, còn hiệu lực phù hợp với
-- src:971 | loại xe đang điều khiển do cơ quan có thẩm quyền cấp, trừ người lái xe gắn máy
-- src:972 | quy định tại khoản 4 Điều này. Khi tham gia giao thông đường bộ, người lái xe
-- src:1003 | 4. Người lái xe gắn máy tham gia giao thông đường bộ phải hiểu biết quy tắc
-- src:1004 | giao thông đường bộ, có kỹ năng điều khiển phương tiện; đủ điều kiện về độ tuổi,
-- src:1005 | sức khỏe theo quy định tại điểm a khoản 1 và khoản 2 Điều 59 của Luật này.

-- Whether driving the vehicle needs a driving licence ("giấy phép lái xe"). A moped needs none
-- (Article 56(4)); a special-use machine needs a licence or, instead, a certificate of
-- training in road-traffic law (Article 56(2)); a rudimentary vehicle needs none. This is the
-- fact Decree 67 Article 7(2)(c) asks about when it limits its licence limbs to motor vehicles
-- that must have a driving licence (NOTES.md section 1.2).
@export Under Vietnam's Law 36/2024 on road traffic, does driving this vehicle require a driving licence (not merely a certificate)?
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 56(1), (2), (4)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle` @desc The vehicle driven, with any trailer it tows
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 56 — a driving licence is required to drive` v MEANS
    CONSIDER `Article 34 — the kind of` v
    WHEN `an automobile`                              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a four-wheeled motorised passenger vehicle` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a four-wheeled motorised goods vehicle`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a motorcycle`                               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a moped`                                    THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a special-use machine`                      THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a motor-assisted bicycle`                   THEN FALSE
    WHEN `another rudimentary vehicle`                THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a trailer`                                  THEN `a trailer or semi-trailer is not driven by itself: describe the vehicle that tows it, with its trailer`
    WHEN `a semi-trailer`                             THEN `a trailer or semi-trailer is not driven by itself: describe the vehicle that tows it, with its trailer`

-- Some licence the driver holds is of a class (with its restriction) that entitles the
-- vehicle, whether or not it is in force: the "phù hợp" (appropriate) test alone.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 57(1), 89(2)
GIVEN p IS A `A driver`
      v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the driver` p `holds a licence whose class entitles the driving of` v MEANS
    any (GIVEN l YIELD     l's `issued by` EQUALS `a competent Vietnamese authority`
                       AND `the class of the licence` l `entitles the driving of` v)
        (p's `driving licences`)

-- Article 56(1): "có giấy phép lái xe đang còn điểm, còn hiệu lực phù hợp với loại xe đang
-- điều khiển do cơ quan có thẩm quyền cấp". Some Vietnamese licence entitles the vehicle and
-- may be driven under on the day. Where none does and the driver holds a foreign or
-- international licence, the model declines.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 56(1), 57, 58(3), 62(5), 89(1)-(2)
GIVEN p IS A `A driver`
      v IS A `A road vehicle`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 56(1) — the driver` p `holds a licence that entitles the driving of` v `on` d MEANS
    IF   any (GIVEN l YIELD     l's `issued by` EQUALS `a competent Vietnamese authority`
                            AND `the class of the licence` l `entitles the driving of` v
                            AND `Article 56(1) — the licence` l `may be driven under on` d)
             (p's `driving licences`)
    THEN TRUE
    ELSE IF   any (GIVEN l YIELD l's `issued by` EQUALS `a foreign or international issuer`) (p's `driving licences`)
         THEN `a foreign or international licence is not mapped onto the classes of Article 57 in this model`
         ELSE FALSE

-- Some Vietnamese licence of any class may be driven under on the day: Article 56(2)'s
-- alternative to the certificate of training in road-traffic law.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 56(2)
GIVEN p IS A `A driver`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the driver` p `holds some licence that may be driven under on` d MEANS
    any (GIVEN l YIELD     l's `issued by` EQUALS `a competent Vietnamese authority`
                       AND `Article 56(1) — the licence` l `may be driven under on` d)
        (p's `driving licences`)

-- The age condition of Articles 56(1), (2), (4) and 59(1), for the vehicle (forks F2, F4, F5).
@export Under Vietnam's Law 36/2024 on road traffic, is this driver of the age the Law requires to drive this vehicle on this day?
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 56, 59(1)
GIVEN p IS A `A driver`        @desc The driver: date of birth, sex, licences and certificates
      v IS A `A road vehicle`  @desc The vehicle driven, with any trailer it tows
      d IS A DATE              @desc The day of driving (for an insurance claim, the day of the accident), on or after 1 January 2025
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 59 — the driver` p `is of the age to drive` v `on` d MEANS
    IF   NOT `Article 88 — this Law governs` d
    THEN `the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources`
    ELSE IF   p's `in the army or police, on defence or security duty`
         THEN `the ages and licences of army and police drivers on defence or security duty are set by their Ministers, whose rules are not in the sources`
         ELSE CONSIDER `Article 34 — the kind of` v
              WHEN `a moped` THEN
                  `has reached` `Article 59(1)(a) — the age from which a person may drive a moped` `years of age, born on` (p's `date of birth`) `, on` d
              WHEN `a special-use machine` THEN
                  `has reached` `Article 59(1)(b) — the age from which a certificate of training in road-traffic law is issued` `years of age, born on` (p's `date of birth`) `, on` d
              WHEN `a motor-assisted bicycle`    THEN TRUE
              WHEN `another rudimentary vehicle` THEN TRUE
              WHEN `a trailer`      THEN `a trailer or semi-trailer is not driven by itself: describe the vehicle that tows it, with its trailer`
              WHEN `a semi-trailer` THEN `a trailer or semi-trailer is not driven by itself: describe the vehicle that tows it, with its trailer`
              OTHERWISE
                      `has reached` (`Article 59(1) — the least issuing age of a class that entitles the driving of` v) `years of age, born on` (p's `date of birth`) `, on` d
                  AND `Article 59(1)(e) — the driver` p `is within the maximum age for` v `on` d

-- Article 56(5): a learner or examinee in a training or test automobile ("xe ô tô"), on the
-- training or test route, with an instructor or examiner, drives without a licence (finding
-- R14). The Law states no age for a learner; the class age of Article 59 is applied (fork F26).
-- src:1006 | 5. Người tập lái xe ô tô, người dự sát hạch lái xe ô tô khi tham gia giao thông
-- src:1007 | đường bộ phải thực hành trên xe tập lái, xe sát hạch trên tuyến đường tập lái, tuyến
-- src:1008 | đường sát hạch, có giáo viên dạy lái hoặc sát hạch viên bảo trợ tay lái. Giáo viên dạy
-- src:1009 | lái, sát hạch viên phải mang theo các loại giấy tờ quy định tại khoản 1 Điều này.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 56(5)
GIVEN p IS A `A driver`
      v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 56(5) — the driver` p `is a learner or examinee permitted to drive` v MEANS
        p's `a learner or examinee in a training or test automobile on its route, with an instructor or examiner`
    AND `Article 34 — the kind of` v EQUALS `an automobile`

-- Decision 1. The licence test comes first, so that a vehicle no class entitles is answered
-- (FALSE) before its age, which Article 59 cannot give, is asked.
@export Under Vietnam's Law 36/2024 on road traffic, may this driver drive this vehicle on this day: of the required age, and holding a licence (or certificate) in force, with points, of a class that entitles the vehicle?
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Articles 56, 57, 58, 59, 62(5), 88, 89
GIVEN p IS A `A driver`        @desc The driver: date of birth, sex, licences (class, issue and expiry dates, restriction, points, revocation, withdrawal) and certificates
      v IS A `A road vehicle`  @desc The vehicle driven, with any trailer it tows
      d IS A DATE              @desc The day of driving (for an insurance claim, the day of the accident), on or after 1 January 2025
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Decision 1 — the driver` p `may drive` v `on` d MEANS
    IF   NOT `Article 88 — this Law governs` d
    THEN `the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources`
    ELSE CONSIDER `Article 34 — the kind of` v
         WHEN `a moped`                     THEN `Article 59 — the driver` p `is of the age to drive` v `on` d
         WHEN `a motor-assisted bicycle`    THEN TRUE
         WHEN `another rudimentary vehicle` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a special-use machine` THEN
                 (   `Article 56(1) — the driver` p `holds a licence that entitles the driving of` v `on` d
                  OR (    p's `holds a certificate to operate this special-use machine`
                      AND (   p's `holds a certificate of training in road-traffic law`
                           OR `the driver` p `holds some licence that may be driven under on` d)))
             AND `Article 59 — the driver` p `is of the age to drive` v `on` d
         OTHERWISE
                 (   `Article 56(1) — the driver` p `holds a licence that entitles the driving of` v `on` d
                  OR `Article 56(5) — the driver` p `is a learner or examinee permitted to drive` v)
             AND `Article 59 — the driver` p `is of the age to drive` v `on` d

-- Article 9(7): handing a motor vehicle or special-use machine to a person who does not meet the
-- conditions to drive it is prohibited. This tests the conditions Decision 1 tests, age and
-- licence; health (Article 59(2)) is not modelled, so a FALSE here does not clear the owner of
-- handing the vehicle to a driver who is unfit (fork F31).
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:251 | 7. Giao xe cơ giới, xe máy chuyên dùng cho người không đủ điều kiện theo
-- src:law36-2024-qh15-977-978:252 | quy định của pháp luật để điều khiển xe tham gia giao thông đường bộ.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 9(7)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
      p IS A `A driver`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 9(7) — handing` v `to` p `is prohibited for want of age or licence, on` d MEANS
        NOT (`Article 2(2) — the group of` v EQUALS `rudimentary vehicles`)
    AND NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` p `may drive` v `on` d

§§ `Decision 2 — alcohol, drugs and stimulants (Articles 9(2)-(3), 81(3), 83(2)(a), 87(5))`

@export Under Vietnam's Law 36/2024 on road traffic, does this alcohol test of a driver exceed the level Decree 67/2023 Article 7(2)(dd) names? The Law permits no alcohol at all (Article 9(2)); only blood alcohol the Ministry of Health's method finds endogenous does not count.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Articles 9(2), 81(3), 83(2)(a), 87(5)
GIVEN t IS A `A test of the driver` @desc The test: blood or breath, the alcohol concentration found (any unit), any Ministry of Health finding that it is endogenous, and whether a prohibited drug or stimulant was found
      d IS A DATE                   @desc The day of the test (the day of the accident), on or after 1 January 2025
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Decision 2 — the test` t `exceeds the permitted level, on` d MEANS
    `the alcohol reading` t `exceeds the level Decree 67 Article 7(2)(dd) names, on` d

@export Under Vietnam's Law 36/2024 on road traffic, did this test of a driver find a narcotic or stimulant the law prohibits? The Law forbids any (Article 9(3)) and states no level.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 9(3), 83(2)(a)
GIVEN t IS A `A test of the driver` @desc The test of the driver
      d IS A DATE                   @desc The day of the test, on or after 1 January 2025
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Decision 2 — the test` t `found a prohibited narcotic or stimulant, on` d MEANS
    `the test` t `found a narcotic or stimulant the law prohibits, on` d

§§ `Decision 3 — revocation and service life (Articles 39(6), 40, 88)`

-- The revocations are answered from the record, whatever the day; the service life only on a
-- day this Law governs. Revocations come first, so a revoked vehicle is answered without its
-- service life.
@export Under Vietnam's Law 36/2024 on road traffic, on this day has the vehicle's registration certificate or plate been revoked, or is the vehicle past its service life?
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Articles 39(6), 40, 88
GIVEN rv IS A `A registered vehicle` @desc The registered vehicle: its description, year of manufacture, any conversion, the year its service life ends under the Government's rules, and its registration record with any revocation dates
      d  IS A DATE                   @desc The day asked about (for Decree 67, the day of the accident or of the insurance)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Decision 3 — the registration or plate of` rv `has been revoked, or it is past its service life, on` d MEANS
        `Article 39 — the registration certificate in` (rv's `registration`) `has been revoked by` d
    OR  `Article 39 — the plate in` (rv's `registration`) `has been revoked by` d
    OR  `Article 40 — the vehicle` rv `is past its service life on` d
